If you need information from outside — ASK the user and WAIT.

## No unrequested exploration

You MUST NOT ask about or research topics not explicitly present in
docs/ai/context.md. In particular:
- Do NOT ask about PHP 8.5 EOL — the spec requires PHP 8.4.
- Do NOT look at third-party blogs (travisbean.com, medium.com, dev.to, etc.).
- Only use: packagist.org, repo.packagist.org, official docs
  (laravel.com/docs, filamentphp.com/docs, livewire.laravel.com),
  github.com raw files of official repositories.

