- Redis, Memcached, SQLite, Supervisor, pcntl, S3/MinIO (spec §6, §32)
- Wildcard `*` in versions
- composer update on production
- restore DB from HTTP admin request (only CLI, spec §24)
- rollback without compatibility check (spec §17)

